sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Client as Maintainer
    participant Ctrl as MaintenanceController
    participant Service as MaintenanceService
    participant StaffSvc as StaffService
    participant DB as Database

    note right of Client: GET /maintenance/my-issues (Bearer Token)
    Client->>Ctrl: GET request
    activate Ctrl
    Ctrl->>Ctrl: AuthGuard & RolesGuard (Maintainer | Manager)

    Ctrl->>Service: listMyIssues(accountId)
    activate Service

    Service->>StaffSvc: findByAccountId(accountId)
    StaffSvc-->>Service: StaffInfo

    alt Staff not found
        Service-->>Client: 403 Forbidden (Staff profile not found)
    end

    Service->>DB: Load IssueAssignments (with issue.room) where MaintainerId = staff.staffId
    DB-->>Service: IssueAssignment[]

    Service-->>Ctrl: IssueAssignment[]
    deactivate Service

    Ctrl-->>Client: 200 OK
    deactivate Ctrl
